{"sectionId":"organic_rxn/alkenes","items":[{"id":"organic_rxn--alkenes-k001","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alkenes","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"alkene의 π 결합은 친전자성 첨가를 할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alkenes-k002","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alkenes","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"HX 첨가는 전형적으로 더 안정한 carbocation을 거쳐 Markovnikov 방향을 보이며 재배열 가능성이 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alkenes-k003","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alkenes","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"peroxide 조건의 HBr radical 첨가는 anti-Markovnikov 생성물을 줄 수 있으나 HCl·HI에 일반화하지 않는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alkenes-k004","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alkenes","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"산촉매 수화는 Markovnikov alcohol, oxymercuration-demercuration은 대체로 재배열 없는 Markovnikov 수화, hydroboration-oxidation은 anti-Markovnikov이며 syn 첨가를 제공한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alkenes-k005","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alkenes","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"Br₂ 첨가는 bromonium 중간체를 거쳐 anti 첨가, Br₂/H₂O는 halohydrin을 형성하며 OH가 더 치환된 탄소에 붙는 경향이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alkenes-k006","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alkenes","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"H₂/Pd 등 촉매 수소화는 보통 syn 첨가, OsO₄ 또는 차갑고 묽은 KMnO₄는 syn diol, ozonolysis는 이중결합 절단 생성물을 준다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alkenes-k007","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alkenes","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"환원성·산화성 후처리에 따라 aldehyde 또는 acid 등의 결과가 달라진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alkenes-k008","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alkenes","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"alkyne은 두 번 첨가할 수 있고 Lindlar 촉매는 cis alkene, Na/NH₃(l)는 trans alkene을 주는 대표 부분 환원 조건이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alkenes-k009","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alkenes","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"말단 alkyne의 Hg²⁺ 촉매 수화는 methyl ketone, 적절한 hydroboration-oxidation은 aldehyde를 준다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alkenes-k010","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alkenes","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"Hydroboration-oxidation: anti-Markovnikov, syn.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alkenes-k011","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alkenes","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"Br₂: anti 첨가 경향.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alkenes-k012","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alkenes","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"HBr/ROOR: radical anti-Markovnikov 대표 조건.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alkenes-k013","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alkenes","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"terminal alkyne은 강염기로 acetylide를 만들어 1차 기질 SN2에 사용할 수 있다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--alkenes-k014","sectionId":"organic_rxn/alkenes","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"1-butanol이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]}]}